  },
  {
    "field_name": "Parser and Normalization Notes",
    "source_file": "BenchmarkSpecDefinitions.xlsx::Workload_Definitions",
    "value": "gcc -O2 -fopenmp compiles an embedded C kernel. NumPy runs only when gcc is missing or the build fails, in chunks of 8e6 updates, with a blank TLB rate and l3_miss_rate of na (LLC load counters unavailable). perf rates are misses/loads; a missing counter stays blank or that na sentence. kind=sample and kind=summary carry the same values"
  },
